### Create Expense
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "Groceries3",
  "amount": 15000
}

### Get All Expenses
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/expenses?page=0&size=5

### Get Expense Stats
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/expenses/stats?topCount=3
